# ── Crossover admin panel (istatistik dashboard) ──
# İZOLE, salt-okunur nginx container'ı (başka projelere dokunmaz):
#   docker run -d --name crossover-admin-1 --restart unless-stopped --network shared-net \
#     -v /opt/crossover/admin:/usr/share/nginx/html:ro nginx:alpine
# Güncelleme:  rsync admin/ → /opt/crossover/admin/  (nginx canlı servis eder, restart yok)
#
# Bu bloğu /root/transyol/Caddyfile'a ekle, sonra:
#   docker exec transyol-caddy-1 caddy reload --config /etc/caddy/Caddyfile --adapter caddyfile
# ÖN KOŞUL: admin.crossoverfootball.com A kaydı → 168.222.180.190 (Hostinger DNS).
# NOT: Panelin verisi ayrı gelir — api.crossoverfootball.com/admin/api/stats (ADMIN_TOKEN korumalı).

admin.crossoverfootball.com {
	reverse_proxy crossover-admin-1:80
	encode gzip
}
